# @hub-lanes

# ── ROADMAP-ISSUE-SYNC LANE (BH-7267, BH-7243.4) ───────────────────────────
# Every 15 minutes it reads the stale roadmap_links (GET
# /api/roadmap/links/stale, capped by roadmap.issue_sync_batch), reads each
# linked GitHub issue ONCE, and writes open, closed_completed or closed_other
# (PUT /api/roadmap/links/state). A rate limit stops the tick. No model call.
# flock -n dedupes.
# Off: flags/lane-off-roadmap-issue-sync, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off
# roadmap-issue-sync.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/roadmap-issue-sync.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
